{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Radiant Defense",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your Channel Divinity to cloak your allies in radiant armor.</p><p>As an Action, you channel blessed energy into an ally that you can see within 30 feet of you. The first time that ally is hit by an attack before you complete a Short or a Long Rest, the attacker takes radiant damage equal to 2d10 + your cleric level.</p>",
